    "detailed_description": "<strong>Precision platforming with a unique twist: instantly flip from ceiling to floor, whether on ground or in air. Chain your double jump with this signature move to overcome 180+ hand crafted levels in many vibrant stages!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/6a4afb2e81e68f8c600aea7a4cddc1e9.poster.avif?t=1674496492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/6a4afb2e81e68f8c600aea7a4cddc1e9.webm?t=1674496492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/6a4afb2e81e68f8c600aea7a4cddc1e9.mp4?t=1674496492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>- Tons of unique level mechanics, all designed around your signature move!<br>- Tight, responsive, fair, fast-paced gameplay!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/8c69c138530a3f16dfbdb5eceebf421d.poster.avif?t=1674496492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/8c69c138530a3f16dfbdb5eceebf421d.webm?t=1674496492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/8c69c138530a3f16dfbdb5eceebf421d.mp4?t=1674496492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Explore for optional collectables and take on special stages, designed to challenge even the most hardcore platforming experts!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/1c969ec7385a3dafd6f53b12dfc36b8a.poster.avif?t=1674496492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/1c969ec7385a3dafd6f53b12dfc36b8a.webm?t=1674496492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/1c969ec7385a3dafd6f53b12dfc36b8a.mp4?t=1674496492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Precision platforming with a unique twist: instantly flip from ceiling to floor, whether on ground or in air. Chain your double jump with this signature move to overcome 180+ hand crafted levels in many vibrant stages!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/6a4afb2e81e68f8c600aea7a4cddc1e9.poster.avif?t=1674496492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/6a4afb2e81e68f8c600aea7a4cddc1e9.webm?t=1674496492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/6a4afb2e81e68f8c600aea7a4cddc1e9.mp4?t=1674496492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>- Tons of unique level mechanics, all designed around your signature move!<br>- Tight, responsive, fair, fast-paced gameplay!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/8c69c138530a3f16dfbdb5eceebf421d.poster.avif?t=1674496492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/8c69c138530a3f16dfbdb5eceebf421d.webm?t=1674496492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/8c69c138530a3f16dfbdb5eceebf421d.mp4?t=1674496492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Explore for optional collectables and take on special stages, designed to challenge even the most hardcore platforming experts!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/1c969ec7385a3dafd6f53b12dfc36b8a.poster.avif?t=1674496492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/1c969ec7385a3dafd6f53b12dfc36b8a.webm?t=1674496492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015460/extras/1c969ec7385a3dafd6f53b12dfc36b8a.mp4?t=1674496492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
